Rules for Implementation: To ensure a secure and reliable integration, please call GrabMaps APIs via backend (proxy) instead of directly from the frontend, in order to achieve the following
- Protect API Credentials: Keep keys hidden from client-side exposure.
- Avoid Browser Limits: Bypass CORS and other browser-related restrictions.
- Better Control: Where possible, manage usage, monitoring, and performance data.
